    <item>
      <title>大型科技公司的人工智能支出持续上升。紧张情绪也是如此。</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/30/technology/amazon-google-ai-data-center-spending.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[亚马逊加入了一系列加大人工智能支出的科技巨头行列，其资本支出飙升了 69%。人们对该行业支出的担忧日益加剧。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/30/technology/amazon-google-ai-data-center-spending.html</guid>
